# One TETRA downlink continuous sync burst (255 symbols = 510 bits, one character per bit), built by
# build_sb() of osmo-tetra's src/conv_enc_test.c (osmo-tetra-sq5bpf 4e9f1b2): SYNC-PDU with MCC 262,
# MNC 42, colour code 0. tetra-rx of the same commit decodes it to the NETINFO1 message in
# transcripts/generator-sync.udp. The generator leaves bit 499 (a phase adjustment bit) unset;
# it is 0 here.

